{"type":"message","id":"a8271927","parentId":"f96965ed","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:45:31.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare error code (1101 = \"Worker threw an exception\"). The send endpoint seems to have a bug on the server side. But the GET /history works fine with X-API-Key header.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform is running normally (read operations work), but the write/send operation is failing with a server-side error (Cloudflare Worker exception).","thinkingSignature":"c257f6687879514534c8860c379ba03e375a4b1a1e22bfad9b99623533ad4f44"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**时间**: 22:45 UTC | 2026-06-02\n\n### ✅ 检查完成\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat | 无人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat | 无人类讨论 |\n\n双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需响应。\n\n### ⚠️ Send API 异常\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **500 (Cloudflare Worker Exception - error code 1101)**，服务器内部错误。读取操作正常，写入被阻断。\n\n```\n< HTTP/2 500 \nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n可能是 Worker 代码中 `send` handler 存在未捕获异常。建议检查服务器日志排查根因。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":388,"output":273,"cacheRead":20288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20949,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780440327664,"responseId":"066e9008e7011091f3b663ae88a95234"}}
